{"parse": {"title": "Corner Permutation of the Last Layer", "pageid": 1987, "redirects": [{"from": "CPLL", "to": "Corner Permutation of the Last Layer"}], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table border=\"1\" class=\"infobox-template\" style=\"float: right; border-collapse:collapse; width: 22em; font-size: 90%; margin: 0 0 10px 10px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" cellspacing=\"2\" style=\"color:black; text-align:center; width: 100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#D0DFEE\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 125%;\"><b>Corner Permutation of the Last Layer</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:90%;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/File:Visualcube_cpll.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/wiki/images/c/cd/Visualcube_cpll.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#E0E8EF\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Information</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Proposer(s):</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/Jessica_Fridrich\" title=\"Jessica Fridrich\">Jessica Fridrichwhile</a> inventing pll?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Proposed:</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\">1981?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Alt Names:</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/CPLL\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CPLL\">CPLL</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Variants:</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A-perm_CPLL&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"A-perm CPLL (page does not exist)\">A-perm CPLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=BLL-4LLL&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"BLL-4LLL (page does not exist)\">BLL-4LLL</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Subgroup:</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>No. Algs:</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\">4; 3 excluding the H <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/EPLL\" title=\"EPLL\">EPLL</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Avg Moves:</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"right\"><b>Purpose(s):</b>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Speedsolving\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Corner Permutation of the Last Layer</b>, abbrevaited <b>CPLL</b>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/Permute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Permute\">permutes</a> the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/Corner\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Corner\">corners</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/Last_layer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Last layer\">last layer</a> without affecting anything else.\nIt has four cases, one of wich is the H perm + U2 and the other are Aa, Ab and E perm\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Corner_Permutation_of_the_Last_Layer&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/PLL\" title=\"PLL\">PLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/EPLL\" title=\"EPLL\">EPLL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/L3C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L3C\">L3C</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/L4C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L4C\">L4C</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/3OP\" title=\"3OP\">3OP</a></li></ul>\n<table border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#808080\">\n<table border=\"0\" align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/File:Scramble_01.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/wiki/images/thumb/1/17/Scramble_01.jpg/80px-Scramble_01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/wiki/images/thumb/1/17/Scramble_01.jpg/120px-Scramble_01.jpg 1.5x, /wiki/images/1/17/Scramble_01.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F0\" align=\"center\"><b>This page is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/DNF\" title=\"DNF\">DNF</a> (incomplete).</b> <br />Please help by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.speedsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Corner_Permutation_of_the_Last_Layer&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a>. <br />There may be suggestions on its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Talk:Corner_Permutation_of_the_Last_Layer&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Talk:Corner Permutation of the Last Layer (page does not exist)\">talk page</a>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"CPLL_Algorithms\">CPLL Algorithms</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Corner_Permutation_of_the_Last_Layer&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: CPLL Algorithms\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 100%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"6\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"f4f4f4\">\n<p>Note that all of these algorithms assume that you are <i>right-hand dominant</i> and know the Western <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/3x3x3_notation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"3x3x3 notation\">notation</a>, where a lowercase letter means a double-layer turn and rotations are denoted by x, y, and z. <small>(<a href=\"/wiki/index.php/Template:Alg\" title=\"Template:Alg\">how to add algorithms</a>)</small>\n</p><p><strong>Click on an algorithm (not the camera icon) to watch an animation of it.</strong>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"H_Permutation\">H Permutation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:H-PLL&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: H Permutation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"3\">\n\n<tbody><tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"25%\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/File:PLL_H.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/wiki/images/2/23/PLL_H.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"75%\">\n<p><small><b>Name: </b>H-PLL, X-PLL</small><br />\n<small><b>Used in: </b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/EPLL\" title=\"EPLL\">EPLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/CPLL\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CPLL\">CPLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/PLL\" title=\"PLL\">PLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/ELL\" title=\"ELL\">ELL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/ZBLL\" title=\"ZBLL\">ZBLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/ZZLL\" title=\"ZZLL\">ZZLL</a></small><br />\n<small><b>Optimal moves: </b>10 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/HTM\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"HTM\">HTM</a>, 7 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/STM\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"STM\">STM</a></small><br />\nX-PLL is H-PLL + U2.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Speedsolving_Algorithms\">Speedsolving Algorithms</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:H-PLL&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-2\" title=\"Edit section: Speedsolving Algorithms\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">PLL\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=PLL&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=M2%27%20U%20M2%27%20U2%20M2%27%20U%20M2%27\">M2' U M2' U2 M2' U M2'</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">PLL\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=PLL&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=M2%27%20U%27%20M2%27%20U2%27%20M2%27%20U%27%20M2%27\">M2' U' M2' U2' M2' U' M2'</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #E8E8E8; width: 55px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pmA8ToRfOXQ&amp;list=PLdk3ru-JmBhRQ4ZySjTGfe0fEoJn-coDt&amp;index=11\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"/wiki/images/2/27/Cube_Camera_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pmA8ToRfOXQ&amp;list=PLdk3ru-JmBhRQ4ZySjTGfe0fEoJn-coDt&amp;index=11\">[1]</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">PLL\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=PLL&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=M2%27%20U2%20M2%27%20U%20M2%27%20U2%20M2%27\">M2' U2 M2' U M2' U2 M2'</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">PLL\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=PLL&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=M2%27%20U2%20M2%27%20U%27%20M2%27%20U%27%20M2%27\">M2' U2 M2' U' M2' U' M2'</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Note that the last two algorithms should only be used as <b>Post-AUF tricks</b>, as it saves having to do a U or U' after the PLL if necessary.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Optimal_Algorithms\">Optimal Algorithms</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:H-PLL&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-3\" title=\"Edit section: Optimal Algorithms\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">HTM 9\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=HTM+9&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=R2%20F2%20B2%20L2%20D%27%20R2%20F2%20B2%20L2\">R2 F2 B2 L2 D' R2 F2 B2 L2</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">STM 7\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=STM+7&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=M2%20D%20S2%20D2%20S2%20D%20M2\">M2 D S2 D2 S2 D M2</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">QTM 12\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=QTM+12&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=R%20L%20U%20U%20R%27%20L%27%20F%27%20B%27%20U%20U%20F%20B\">R L U U R' L' F' B' U U F B</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"font-family: Tahoma; font-size: 110%; line-height: 100%; border: 1px solid #CCC; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 1px 5px; background: #FFFFFF; width: 18px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/wiki/images/5/59/Speedsolving_Logo_tiny.gif\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F8F8F8; width: 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #CCC;\">QSTM 12\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 5px; background: #F0F0F0; width: 375px; border: 1px solid #CCC;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://alg.cubing.net/?puzzle=3x3x3&amp;stage=QSTM+12&amp;type=alg&amp;view=playback&amp;alg=R%20L%20U%20U%20R%27%20L%27%20F%27%20B%27%20U%20U%20F%20B\">R L U U R' L' F' B' U U F B</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Aa_Permutation\">Aa Permutation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:A-PLL(a)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Aa Permutation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"3\">\n\n<tbody><tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"25%\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/File:PLL_A(a).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/wiki/images/3/37/PLL_A%28a%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"75%\">\n<p><small><b>Name: </b>A-PLL a</small><br />\n<small><b>Used in: </b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php/CPLL\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CPLL\">CPLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/PLL\" title=\"PLL\">PLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/L3C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L3C\">L3C</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/L4C\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"L4C\">L4C</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/ZBLL\" title=\"ZBLL\">ZBLL</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/BLD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"BLD\">BLD</a></small><br />\n<small><b>Optimal moves: </b>9 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php/HTM\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"HTM\">HTM</a></small><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Speedsolving_Algorithms_2\">Speedsolving Algorithms</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:A-PLL(a)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-2\" title=\"Edit section: